to infection. Applying knowledge of glucocorticoid function to a novel clinical scenario, one predicts the combined effect of elevated glucose alongside suppressed immunity, identifying elevated fasting blood glucose as the expected finding.', 'medium', '3A', 'Endocrine System: Hormones and Their Sources', 'biology', 2, 75, NULL)
  RETURNING id
)
